 <h3><u>Abbas Bohot dushwari hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>MERA ABBAS BHAIYYA ABBAS, MERA ABBAS BHAIYYA ABBAS.<br> ABBAS BOHOT DUSHWARI HAI, ABBAS BOHOT DUSHWARI HAI<br> ZENAB NE KAHA ROKAR BHAYYA SAR KHULNE KI TAYYARI HAI,<br> &nbsp;ABBAS BAHOT DUSHWARI HAI *2<br> BADHTA HAI MERI JANIB LASHKAR AA JALDI AA DAR TAARI HAI<br> ABBAS BAHOTDUSHWARI HAI *2</p> 
  <p>1- AAKHIR ME KAROO’N KY BATLA DE..KOI RAH TO MUJHKO DIKHLA DE<br> AISA NA HO MUJHPAR DHAYE’N SITAM..ME KON HOON INKO SAMJHA DE<br> SUNTI HOO’N KE TERI DARYA PAR *2,&nbsp; IS WAQT ALAMBARDARI HAI.<br> ABBAS BAHOTDUSHWARI HAI *2</p> 
  <p>2- KYUN LETA NAHI HAI MERI KHABAR..ME HO GAEIN HOO’N GHAR SE BE GHAR<br> DARTI HOO’N NA CHHIN JAYE CHADAR..HAI DEKH QAYAMAT KA MANZAR<br> KYUN KARTA NAHI IMDAAD MERI *2, KYA BAAT HAI JO BE ZAARI HAI<br> &nbsp;ABBAS BAHOT DUSHWARI HAI *2</p> 
  <p>3- KYA ISSE BADA BHI HOGA SITAM…AB NARGHA E AADA ME HAIN HAM<br> SAANSE’N HAIN GALE ME ATKI HUI LAGTA HAI NIKAL JAYEGA DAM<br> KARTI HAI SAKINA YAAD TUJHE *2, GHABRAEI HUI BECHARI HAI<br> &nbsp;ABBAS BAHOT DUSHWARI HAI *2</p> 
  <p>4- KHEMO KO JALAYA JAATA HAI..BE JURM SATAYA JAATA HAI<br> AA DEKH MERE GHAZI QAIDI…AABID KO BANAYA JAATA HAI<br> PEHNATE HAIN ZALIM ZANJEERE’N *2,&nbsp; AUR TAUQ GALE ME&nbsp; BHAARI HAI<br> &nbsp;ABBAS BAHOT DUSHWARI HAI *2</p> 
  <p>5- AISE ME KARE KYA TERI BAHAN…BANDHTI HAI MERE SHANO ME RASAN<br> KIS TARHA RAKHOO’N DIL PAR QABU..KIS TARHA KAROO’N YE ZULM SAHAN<br> GHAIRAT SE MERA PHATTA HAI JIGAR *2, SAANSO’N ME BHI AAHO ZAARI HAI<br> &nbsp;ABBAS BAHOT DUSHWARI HAI *2</p> 
  <p>6- KISTARHA JIYE’N NAAZO’N KE PALE..HAIN AIK RASAN ME 12 GALE<br> HASTE HAIN MERI GHURBAT PE LAEE’N..DIN YE BHI MERI TAQDEER ME THE<br> ZINDA MUJHE BHAYYA RAKKHE HUYE *2, IS WAQT MERI KHUDDARI HAI<br> &nbsp;ABBAS BAHOT DUSHWARI HAI *2</p> 
  <p>7- KODO’N PE ME KODE KHAATI HOO’N…AUR KUCHH BHI NAHI KEH PAATI HOO’N<br> JAB DEKHTI HOO’N NEZO’N PE SAR…DIL THAM KE BAS REH JAATI HOO’N<br> HOTE HAI MUSALSAL ZULM O SITAM *2, GHURBAT KA SAFAR BHI JAARI HAI<br> &nbsp;ABBAS BAHOT DUSHWARI HAI *2</p> 
  <p>8- EY TISHNA JIGAR EY TISHNA DAHAA’N..EY SHERE GHAZNFAR RAAHAT E JAA’N<br> ITNA TO BATA DE ZENAB KO MANZIL HAI KAHA’N JANA HAI KAHA’N<br> BITHHLATE HAIN ZALIM NAAQE PAR *2&nbsp; KIS ZULM KI YE TAYYARI HAI<br> ABBAS BAHOT DUSHWARI HAI *2</p> 
  <p>9- ASIF JO SUKHAN ZENAB KE SUNE..ABBAS LABE DARYA TADPE<br> SHABBIR KA SAR ROYA AAMIR..AANKHO’N KO NA KHOLA GHAZI NE ..<br> KEHTI RAHI KHAHAR RO ROKAR *2&nbsp; IMDAAD KO AA LAACHARI<br> HAI ABBAS BAHOT DUSHWARI HAI *2<br> MERA ABBAS BHAIYYA ABBAS, MERA ABBAS BHAIYYA ABBAS.</p> 
